<Frame title="Conversational style"><h1>Conversational style</h1><p class="lede">How models tend to respond across conversations.</p><p class="notice">These are style tendencies, not quality scores: higher is not better. They use the upstream traits rubric and are not part of the rating.</p><p>Each score is a mean from 0 to 10, averaged across conversations. Both judges assess each conversation. Partial results are marked in progress.</p><p class="footnote">Open a model for detailed style profiles and uncertainty intervals.</p><TraitHeatmaps/></Frame>
